Bugfix: Fix `stats` progress bar resetting its counters for every snapshot

The progress bar of `restic stats` reset its file, blob and size counters
at the start of each snapshot, so the final progress line only showed the
numbers for the last processed snapshot. These numbers varied between runs
depending on the order in which snapshots were processed. The progress bar
now counts across all selected snapshots.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22112
